<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>My Jobs · GigHub</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/registration.css?v=4"><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/jobs.css"></head><body>
<header class="site-header"><a class="brand" href="?route=/">GigHub</a><nav aria-label="Client navigation"><a href="?route=/client">Client home</a><a href="?route=/client/jobs/create">Post a Job</a></nav></header><main class="jobs-layout"><div class="jobs-heading"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT COLLABORATION</p><h1>My Jobs</h1><p>Your drafts and posted jobs, visible here only to you.</p><a class="job-link-button" href="?route=/client/jobs/create">Post a Job</a></div>
